apated to living in extreme conditions?</p>\n"}, {"alt": "A curlew - a British wading bird with a long beak. It is bending its head so that its beak touches the sand.", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Curlew blob", "imageUrl": "1730806369463_Curlew blob-zgAYXaOpTKjHT_fmQUrOs.png", "fileIdentifier": "zgAYXaOpTKjHT_fmQUrOs", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Why might a curlew have a long beak?&nbsp;</p>\n"}, {"alt": "A whale swimming in the sea. You can see its blowhole.", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Whale blob", "imageUrl": "1730806581686_Whale blob-XTTQzAclkolL0wsjLMI8U.png", "fileIdentifier": "XTTQzAclkolL0wsjLMI8U", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Is the lack of gills a problem for whales?</p>\n"}, {"alt": "A pink rose", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Rose blob", "imageUrl": "1730806582330_Rose blob-Q5iVcbsddyhBfUxQ1fdct.png", "fileIdentifier": "Q5iVcbsddyhBfUxQ1fdct", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Why do roses smell so sweet?</p>\n"}, {"alt": "A cactus with pink flowers, growing in a rocky desert. It looks hot.", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Cactus blob", "imageUrl": "1730806583402_Cactus blob-cfFOEzbxcvlK8yat95bzM.png", "fileIdentifier": "cfFOEzbxcvlK8yat95bzM", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Would a cactus be happier living somewhere else?</p>\n"}, {"alt": "Rocks poking out from the snow. It might even be a glacier!", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Ice age blob", "imageUrl": "1730806583749_Ice age blob-iQ46XlBQ-KE_Dl-cpXC9o.png", "fileIdentifier": "iQ46XlBQ-KE_Dl-cpXC9o", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Which creatures could best survive an ice age?</p>\n"}, {"alt": "A capybara ", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Capybara blob", "imageUrl": "1730806617912_Capybara blob-1l36XocVZYdtN5_-PwAjz.png", "fileIdentifier": "1l36XocVZYdtN5_-PwAjz", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p>Why are there no rodents larger than a capybara?</p>\n"}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "h_lcZiv6VptVaHSVLopob", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]